*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% ============================================================
*% Epson 24 针针式打印机 (ESC/P2)，由 ghostscript 的 lq850 设备驱动。
*% 用于 LQ-850 / LQ-850+ / LQ-1050 / LQ-1170 / LQ-570 / LQ-300K / LQ-630K
*% 这类支持 ESC/P2 的 24 针机；9 针机请用 gs 的 epson / escp 设备。
*%
*% 链路: 客户端 PDF/PS -> [cups-filters pdftops] -> PS
*%       -> foomatic-rip -> gs -sDEVICE=lq850 -> ESC/P2 -> 打印机
*% 说明: 该 PPD 是数据文件, 驱动引擎全部来自 cups-filters + ghostscript,
*%       没有私有代码。分辨率/进纸等选项故意保持最小, 由 gs 设备的默认值决定。
*% ============================================================
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "LQ850.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Epson"
*ModelName: "Epson LQ-850"
*ShortNickName: "Epson LQ-850"
*NickName: "Epson LQ-850 24-pin (ESC/P2, ghostscript)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*SNMPDevice: ""
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Epson;MDL:LQ-850;CMD:ESCP;"
*cupsVersion: 1.1
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-postscript 0 foomatic-rip"
*FoomaticRIPCommandLine: "gs -q -dBATCH -dPARANOIDSAFER -dNOPAUSE -sDEVICE=lq850 -sOutputFile=- -"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Paper Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[419.53 595.28]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/B5: "<</PageSize[498.9 708.66]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 16K184x260/16K 184x260mm: "<</PageSize[521.57 737.01]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 16K195x270/16K 195x270mm: "<</PageSize[552.76 765.35]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Env10/Envelope #10: "<</PageSize[297.64 683.15]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvDL/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[311.81 623.62]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Custom/Custom: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Paper Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[419.53 595.28]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/B5: "<</PageSize[498.9 708.66]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 16K184x260/16K 184x260mm: "<</PageSize[521.57 737.01]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 16K195x270/16K 195x270mm: "<</PageSize[552.76 765.35]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Env10/Envelope #10: "<</PageSize[297.64 683.15]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvDL/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[311.81 623.62]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Custom/Custom: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "8.5 8.5 586.8 833.4"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "8.5 8.5 603.5 783.5"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "8.5 8.5 603.5 999.5"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "8.5 8.5 411.0 586.8"
*ImageableArea B5/B5: "8.5 8.5 490.4 700.2"
*ImageableArea 16K184x260/16K 184x260mm: "8.5 8.5 513.1 728.5"
*ImageableArea 16K195x270/16K 195x270mm: "8.5 8.5 544.3 756.9"
*ImageableArea Env10/Envelope #10: "8.5 8.5 289.1 674.6"
*ImageableArea EnvDL/Envelope DL: "8.5 8.5 303.3 615.1"
*ImageableArea Custom/Custom: "8.5 8.5 586.8 833.4"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595.28 841.89"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "419.53 595.28"
*PaperDimension B5/B5: "498.9 708.66"
*PaperDimension 16K184x260/16K 184x260mm: "521.57 737.01"
*PaperDimension 16K195x270/16K 195x270mm: "552.76 765.35"
*PaperDimension Env10/Envelope #10: "297.64 683.15"
*PaperDimension EnvDL/Envelope DL: "311.81 623.62"
*PaperDimension Custom/Custom: "595.28 841.89"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Output Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 180dpi
*Resolution 180dpi/180 DPI: "<</HWResolution[180 180]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 360dpi/360 DPI: "<</HWResolution[360 360]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *Duplex/2-Sided Printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(001.004)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-Bold: Standard "(001.004)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-Oblique: Standard "(001.004)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-BoldOblique: Standard "(001.004)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-Bold: Standard "(001.007)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-Oblique: Standard "(001.006)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-BoldOblique: Standard "(001.007)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Bold: Standard "(001.007)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Italic: Standard "(001.007)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-BoldItalic: Standard "(001.009)" Standard ROM

*% 针打常用: 只走 monochrome
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*VariablePaperSize: True
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*Throughput: "1"
*LanguageLevel: "3"

*OpenGroup: General/General
*OpenUI *cupsPrintQuality/Print Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *cupsPrintQuality
*DefaultcupsPrintQuality: Normal
*cupsPrintQuality Draft/Draft: ""
*cupsPrintQuality Normal/Normal: ""
*CloseUI: *cupsPrintQuality
*CloseGroup: General
